  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nat 306.04 Didactic Training. The required didactic training shall be that required by any United States jurisdiction for authorization to practice:\n\n(a) Naturopathic obstetrics;\n\n(b) Nurse midwifery; or\n\n(c) Traditional midwifery.\n\nSource. #8514, eff 12-13-05, EXPIRED: 12-13-13\n\nNew. #12176, eff 5-17-17",
